# Frosty AI Assistant — Backend Documentation

> **Project**: Frosty LangGraph Backend  
> **Stack**: FastAPI + LangGraph + OpenAI + PostgreSQL (Supabase)  
> **Last Updated**: 2026-02-28

---

## Architecture Overview

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A["Client (Frontend)"] -->|"POST /chat"| B["app.py (FastAPI)"]
    B -->|"Rate Limit + Validation"| C{"Audio?"}
    C -->|"Yes"| D["voice_tool.py (Whisper STT)"]
    C -->|"No"| E["Use text message"]
    D --> E
    E --> F{"Awaiting Confirmation?"}
    F -->|"Yes"| G["handle_confirmation()"]
    F -->|"No"| H["LangGraph (main.py)"]
    H --> I["classify_intent_node"]
    I -->|"schedule_meeting"| J["schedule_meeting_node"]
    I -->|"send_email"| K["email_flow_node"]
    I -->|"normal_chat / other"| L["normal_chat_node"]
    J --> M["Google Calendar API"]
    K --> N["SMTP Email"]
    G --> O["Response"]
    J --> O
    K --> O
    L --> O
    O -->|"voice_response?"| P["tts_tool.py (TTS)"]
    P --> Q["JSON Response + audio_response"]
    O --> Q
```

---

## Project Structure

```
frosty-langgraph/
├── app.py                  # FastAPI server, /chat and /health endpoints
├── main.py                 # LangGraph definition, chat_router()
├── nodes.py                # All LangGraph node functions
├── state.py                # TypedDict state definitions
├── config.py               # Settings loader (env vars)
├── db_config.py            # DB connection + table creation
├── session_store.py        # Session history, state, summary, profile DB ops
├── knowledge_base.py       # Company knowledge context
├── logger_config.py        # Centralized logging
├── requirements.txt        # Python dependencies
├── Dockerfile              # Production Docker config
├── .dockerignore            # Docker build exclusions
├── .env                    # Environment variables (secrets)
├── tools/
│   ├── llm_tool.py         # LLM intent extraction with memory
│   ├── calendar_tool.py    # Google Calendar event creation
│   ├── email_tool.py       # SMTP email sending
│   ├── voice_tool.py       # Whisper STT (audio → text)
│   └── tts_tool.py         # OpenAI TTS (text → audio)
└── memory/
    ├── __init__.py
    └── user_profile.py     # User profile extraction & persistence
```

