## API Reference

### `GET /health`

```json
// Response
{"status": "ok"}
```

### `POST /chat`

**Request:**
```json
{
    "session_id": "unique-session-id",
    "message": "Hello",              // Optional (if audio provided)
    "audio": "base64_encoded_audio", // Optional (if message provided)
    "voice_response": false          // Optional, default false
}
```

> At least one of [message](file:///c:/Users/ayush/OneDrive/Desktop/frosty-langgraph/session_store.py#50-83) or [audio](file:///c:/Users/ayush/OneDrive/Desktop/frosty-langgraph/tools/voice_tool.py#7-59) must be provided.

**Response:**
```json
{
    "intent": "normal_chat | schedule_meeting | send_email | confirmation_reply | error",
    "reply": "Assistant's text response",
    "audio_response": "base64_encoded_audio_or_empty",
    "audio_mime": "audio/wav"
}
```

**Intent values:**

| Intent | Trigger |
|---|---|
| [normal_chat](file:///c:/Users/ayush/OneDrive/Desktop/frosty-langgraph/nodes.py#448-592) | General conversation |
| [schedule_meeting](file:///c:/Users/ayush/OneDrive/Desktop/frosty-langgraph/nodes.py#255-342) | User wants to schedule a meeting |
| [send_email](file:///c:/Users/ayush/OneDrive/Desktop/frosty-langgraph/tools/email_tool.py#19-72) | User wants to send an email |
| `confirmation_reply` | Response to email confirmation prompt |
| `error` | Validation or processing error |

---

## Request Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant A as app.py
    participant R as chat_router
    participant G as LangGraph
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    C->>A: POST /chat {session_id, message/audio}
    A->>A: Rate limit check
    A->>A: STT if audio provided
    A->>R: chat_router(session_id, state, message)
    R->>DB: Load session state
    
    alt Awaiting Confirmation
        R->>R: handle_confirmation(yes/no)
        R->>DB: Update state
    else Normal Flow
        R->>G: graph.invoke(state)
        G->>G: classify_intent_node (LLM)
        alt schedule_meeting
            G->>G: schedule_meeting_node
            G-->>G: Google Calendar API
        else send_email
            G->>G: email_flow_node
            G->>DB: Save state (awaiting_confirmation)
        else normal_chat
            G->>G: normal_chat_node (LLM)
            G->>DB: Save messages + profile
        end
        R->>DB: Save session state
    end
    
    A->>A: TTS if voice_response=true
    A->>C: JSON response
```

