## Environment Variables

| Variable | Required | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `OPENAI_API_KEY` | ✅ | OpenAI API (LLM, Whisper, TTS) |
| `DATABASE_URL` | ✅ | PostgreSQL connection string |
| `SMTP_HOST` | ✅ | Email server (e.g., `smtp.gmail.com`) |
| `SMTP_PORT` | ❌ | Email port (default: `587`) |
| `SMTP_USER` | ✅ | Email account username |
| `SMTP_PASS` | ✅ | Email account password / app password |
| `SMTP_FROM` | ❌ | Sender email address |
| `GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS` | ❌ | Path to Google service account JSON (for Calendar) |
| `PORT` | ❌ | Server port (default: `8000`) |

---

## Docker Deployment

**Build:**
```bash
docker build -t frosty-langgraph .
```

**Run (with env file):**
```bash
docker run -d --name frosty -p 8000:8000 --env-file .env frosty-langgraph
```

**Run (with inline env vars):**
```bash
docker run -d --name frosty -p 8000:8000 \
  -e OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-... \
  -e DATABASE_URL=postgresql://... \
  -e SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com \
  -e SMTP_USER=you@example.com \
  -e SMTP_PASS=your_pass \
  frosty-langgraph
```

**Verify:**
```bash
curl http://localhost:8000/health
# → {"status": "ok"}
```

> For Google Calendar, mount credentials: `-v /path/to/creds.json:/app/credentials.json`

