## Remaining / Potential Work

| # | Item | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | **Frontend integration** | Build UI that posts to `/chat`, plays `audio_response` |
| 2 | **Google Calendar OAuth** | Currently uses service account — may need user-level OAuth for personal calendars |
| 3 | **Rate limiter persistence** | Currently in-memory, resets on restart — consider Redis for multi-instance |
| 4 | **Meeting confirmation guard** | Meetings are auto-created — may want a confirm step like email |
| 5 | **File/image attachments** | State supports `image_url` but no processing logic yet |
| 6 | **Multi-language support** | Profile has `preferred_language` field but no translation logic |
| 7 | **Webhook integrations** | n8n-style webhook triggers not yet ported |
| 8 | **Unit/integration tests** | No test suite exists yet |
| 9 | **CI/CD pipeline** | No automated deployment pipeline |
| 10 | **HTTPS / Auth** | No API authentication — needed before public deployment |
| 11 | **Knowledge base from Google Sheets** | State supports `raw_sheet_data` but currently uses hardcoded placeholders |
| 12 | **Ticket system** | State has `ticket_id`/`ticket_number` fields but no implementation |
